// Example TRIPOLI-4 radiation shielding assembly using TYPE macro-shapes, EQUA, COMPOSITION, and GEOMCOMP.
LANG ENGLISH

GEOMETRY

TITLE Shielded gamma/neutron calibration benchmark with collimator cone

TYPE 1 BOX 100.0 100.0 100.0        // Outer shield cube (-50..50 cm)
TYPE 2 SPHERE 12.0                   // Inner heavy-water target sphere

SURF 10 CYLZ 0.0 0.0 30.0            // Steel reflector outer cylinder
SURF 11 PLANEZ -35.0                 // Reflector bottom plane
SURF 12 PLANEZ  35.0                 // Reflector top plane
SURF 13 CONEZ 0.0 0.0 12.0 18.4349488 // Collimator half-angle (tan = 1/3)
SURF 14 PLANEZ  12.0                 // Collimator apex cut
SURF 15 PLANEZ  50.0                 // Top shield outer plane

VOLU 1 COMBI 1 ENDV                  // Outer Borated Polyethylene Shield
VOLU 2 EQUA PLUS 1 11 MINUS 2 10 12 ECRASE 1 1 ENDV // Stainless Steel Reflector
VOLU 3 COMBI 2 0.0 0.0 0.0 ECRASE 2 2 1 ENDV // Heavy Water Target
VOLU 4 EQUA PLUS 1 14 MINUS 2 15 13 ECRASE 2 1 2 ENDV // Collimator Duct

ENDG

COMPOSITION
3
DENSITY 300 bpe 0.95 NB_ATOM 3
  H1 2.0
  C_NAT 1.0
  B10 0.05
DENSITY 300 steel 7.92 NB_ATOM 3
  FE56 0.70
  CR52 0.20
  NI58 0.10
DENSITY 300 d2o 1.10 NB_ATOM 2
  H2 2.0
  O16 1.0
END_COMPOSITION

GEOMCOMP
  bpe   1 1
  steel 1 2
  d2o   1 3
  VIDE  1 4
END_GEOMCOMP

END
